    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/bvam01-ut/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_PRODUCT&editorId=620625127830192739&sectionId=620625464968348259)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggU4PxSsZHl_text","label":"ggU4PxSsZHl_text","default":"<p>24/10/2025</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkLC3foaPZ_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggkLC3foaPZ_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2005/9307/files/423564678.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSlAY1pKWQ_text","label":"ggSlAY1pKWQ_text","default":"<p>Mark T.&nbsp;</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggksxuAmHxc_text","label":"ggksxuAmHxc_text","default":"<p>Weekend Golfer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoWUnVb3kF_text","label":"ggoWUnVb3kF_text","default":"<p>I heard the click on day three. My ball striking changed that week.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOgXkf8oj4_text","label":"ggOgXkf8oj4_text","default":"<p>\"I've been playing for six years and always struggled with early release — my coach kept telling me but I couldn't feel it. Within three days of using the Pro Swing Click Trainer, I actually heard the difference between a good release and a bad one. By the end of the week my divots were in front of the ball for the first time. It's the kind of feedback no lesson ever gave me.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIXOrhvd2H_text","label":"ggIXOrhvd2H_text","default":"<p><strong>Golfer Now </strong>replied</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvX1zYlwTv_text","label":"ggvX1zYlwTv_text","default":"<p>That's exactly what it's designed for, Mark — turning feel into something you can actually hear. Keep clicking. 🏌️</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg74FjjuAr1_text","label":"gg74FjjuAr1_text","default":"<p>13/05/2025</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6QI7W0XMR_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg6QI7W0XMR_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2005/9307/files/456786.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPaP3S5e7g_text","label":"ggPaP3S5e7g_text","default":"<p>Derek S.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNXGx6y8wY_text","label":"ggNXGx6y8wY_text","default":"<p>Club Member</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_C_DhuHL4_text","label":"gg_C_DhuHL4_text","default":"<p>I've tried every training aid. This is the only one I still use.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg99kNJ5ivZ_text","label":"gg99kNJ5ivZ_text","default":"<p>\"I've bought alignment sticks, impact bags, weighted clubs — most end up in the garage after a month. The Pro Swing Click Trainer is different because the feedback is immediate and honest. It doesn't lie to you. If your timing is off, there's no click. When it clicks, you know your lag and release are exactly where they need to be. I use it for 10 minutes before every round as a warm-up now.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcXmxhlLXs_text","label":"ggcXmxhlLXs_text","default":"<p><strong>Golfer Now</strong> replied</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggu5gULoMvk_text","label":"ggu5gULoMvk_text","default":"<p>10 minutes before a round — that's the perfect warm-up routine, Derek. Love hearing this. 🏌️</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiZGlo-Vkd_text","label":"ggiZGlo-Vkd_text","default":"<p>10/12/2025</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggE2_tqLnNI_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggE2_tqLnNI_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2005/9307/files/768657543.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr1emIvuHD_text","label":"ggr1emIvuHD_text","default":"<p>Sophie Tran</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghVhulzgX9_text","label":"gghVhulzgX9_text","default":"<p>Weekend Golfer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJpim0BNcR_text","label":"ggJpim0BNcR_text","default":"<p>Took a couple of weeks to get used to — but it works.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnkWs1xN7m_text","label":"ggnkWs1xN7m_text","default":"<p>\"Honestly the first few sessions were a bit frustrating. I wasn't clicking at all and started to wonder if I was doing something wrong. But I stuck with it and around day 10 something clicked — literally. My release timing is noticeably better and my divots are finally in front of the ball. Would've given 5 stars but the instructions that come with it are pretty basic, took me a while to figure out the right grip pressure. Once I got it though, real difference.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-A6LFtF6A_text","label":"gg-A6LFtF6A_text","default":"<p><strong>Golfer Now</strong> replied</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvoRov3wIb_text","label":"ggvoRov3wIb_text","default":"<p>Thank you Sophie — the first few sessions are always the hardest part. That frustration usually means your old habit is fighting back. Glad you pushed through it. We appreciate the note!</p>"}],
